[12:14:08.982] Restore start slot=quick-3 generation=7
[12:14:09.011] Player died; retry requested
[12:14:09.018] SceneBootstrapper subscribed: Level_02
[12:14:09.044] SnapshotRestored generation=7 listeners=2
[12:14:09.046] Inventory.Apply items=14 source=restore
[12:14:09.047] Inventory.Apply items=14 source=restore
[12:14:09.301] HUD bound to InventoryModel instance=0x71A
```

