`dma_.start` invokes its callback from `HAL_DMA2D_TransferCompleteCallback`, which runs on the DMA interrupt path. `Frame` is reference-counted in the desktop build, but the target build uses an intrusive counter with `release()` implemented in `FrameBuffer.cpp`.

